---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const ld = [{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://dsignpoint.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Approach", "item": "https://dsignpoint.com/approach/"}]}];
---
<Layout title="Our approach | DsignPoint" description="We don't start with your brand. We start with your business. See how DsignPoint moves from diagnosis to strategy, build and growth in one partnership." path="/approach/" ogImage="/og/ap_hero.jpg"   jsonld={ld}>


<div style="position:relative;overflow-x:hidden;">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:min(62vh,600px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);overflow:hidden;background:oklch(18% 0.04 20);">
    <img src="../uploads/ap_hero.webp" alt="Founder writing in a notebook at her desk by a large window" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 40%;transform-origin:center;" class="hero-zoom">
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, oklch(15% 0.05 20 / 0.35) 0%, oklch(15% 0.05 20 / 0.15) 40%, oklch(12% 0.06 18 / 0.92) 100%);"></div>

    <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px clamp(20px,5vw,56px);width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <a href=".." class="dp-logo" aria-label="DsignPoint home"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;"><img src="../uploads/DP-icon-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="" style="height:48px;width:auto;display:block;"><img src="../uploads/DP-wordmark-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="DsignPoint" style="height:24px;width:auto;display:block;"></span></a>
      <button type="button" class="dp-burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="dp-nav"><span></span><span></span></button><div id="dp-nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Main" class="dp-nav-links" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(14px,2vw,30px);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">
        <a href=".." style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Home</a>
        <a href="./" aria-current="page" style="color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(83% 0.05 80);padding-bottom:3px;">Approach</a>
        <a href="../case-studies/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Case Studies</a>
        <a href="../insights/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">Insights</a>
        <a href="../about/" style="color:oklch(88% 0.015 60);">About</a>
        <a href="../book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid oklch(83% 0.05 80);background:oklch(83% 0.05 80);color:oklch(24% 0.11 15);padding:12px 24px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 8px 28px oklch(83% 0.05 80 / 0.35);transition:background 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h1">Book a call <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,56px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 24px;">Approach</p>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,64px);line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 28px;max-width:24ch;">
        Your business doesn't exist<br>
        <span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">separately from you.</span>
      </h1>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:clamp(20px,3vw,48px);align-items:end;">
        <p style="font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,18px);line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:oklch(92% 0.015 50);max-width:52ch;">
          The way you think, what you value, what you've learned, what you've outgrown and where you want to go inevitably shape the business you're building.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-self:end;">
          <a href="../book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);padding:17px 36px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;transition:background 0.35s ease, gap 0.35s ease;" class="h2">Let's talk <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);padding-top:clamp(72px,11vh,130px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,11vh,130px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px;">And as you change, the business changes with you.</p>
        <p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,4vh,44px);color:oklch(40% 0.01 30 / 0.75);">Sometimes the business simply hasn't caught up yet.</p>
        <div style="margin:0 0 clamp(32px,5vh,52px);"><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 0;max-width:28ch;">The offer still reflects an earlier version of you.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 5%;max-width:28ch;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);">The brand tells an old story.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 10%;max-width:28ch;">The positioning no longer feels quite right.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 15%;max-width:28ch;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);">The way you present the business doesn't match the level you're operating at.</p></div>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,32px);line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:24ch;">We believe the strongest businesses are aligned with the people behind them.</p>
        <p style="font-size:16px;font-weight:500;margin:0;">Our job is to bring the two back into alignment.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/ap_change.webp" alt="Founder reflecting at her desk while a colleague reviews the work" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%;"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);padding-top:clamp(80px,13vh,150px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,11vh,130px);">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(27px,4.6vw,66px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 clamp(32px,6vh,60px);max-width:16ch;">
        Not everything that feels wrong needs to be <span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(38% 0.15 17);">changed.</span>
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 clamp(28px,5vh,48px);max-width:56ch;">Before we decide what to build, we look at both sides of the equation:</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px);margin-bottom:clamp(56px,10vh,100px);">
        <div style="background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);">
          <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(47% 0.17 19);margin:0 0 16px;">The owner</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,26px);line-height:1.25;margin:0;">Your story, experience, perspective, ambitions and the direction you're moving in.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:oklch(33% 0.14 17);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(28px,3.4vw,48px);margin-top:clamp(0px,4vw,56px);">
          <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);margin:0 0 16px;">The business</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,26px);line-height:1.25;margin:0;">Your positioning, offer, audience, brand, digital presence and the way the business currently operates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);margin:0 0 clamp(20px,3vh,32px);">Then we look at the space between them.</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,42px);line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin:0;"><span style="">What still fits?</span> <span style="color:oklch(45% 0.05 25);">What has become outdated?</span> <span style="">What's missing?</span> <span style="color:oklch(45% 0.05 25);">What's getting in the way of where you want to go?</span> </p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-top:clamp(0px,4vw,52px);">
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,32px);line-height:1.25;margin:0;"><span style="">Sometimes the answer is a new identity.</span> <span style="color:oklch(45% 0.05 25);">Sometimes it's a sharper offer.</span> <span style="">Sometimes it's a different position in the market.</span> <span style="color:oklch(45% 0.05 25);">Sometimes the website is the problem.</span> <span style="color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);font-style:italic;">And sometimes, nothing needs to be rebuilt.</span> </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:clamp(72px,14vh,160px) clamp(20px,5vw,56px);text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 90% at 15% 0%, oklch(38% 0.15 17 / 0.9) 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 90% 100%, oklch(13% 0.07 15 / 0.95) 0%, transparent 65%), oklch(24% 0.11 15);">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/DP-icon-yvoir-cropped.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;right:-6%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);height:150%;width:auto;opacity:0.07;pointer-events:none;">
      <div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27220%27%20height%3D%27220%27%3E%3Cfilter%20id%3D%27n%27%3E%3CfeTurbulence%20type%3D%27fractalNoise%27%20baseFrequency%3D%270.85%27%20numOctaves%3D%273%27%20stitchTiles%3D%27stitch%27%2F%3E%3CfeColorMatrix%20values%3D%270%200%200%200%201%20%200%200%200%200%201%20%200%200%200%200%201%20%200%200%200%200.6%200%27%2F%3E%3C%2Ffilter%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27100%25%27%20height%3D%27100%25%27%20filter%3D%27url%28%23n%29%27%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E);opacity:0.09;mix-blend-mode:soft-light;pointer-events:none;"></div>
      <div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 50%, transparent 40%, oklch(10% 0.06 15 / 0.55) 100%);pointer-events:none;"></div>
      <p style="position:relative;font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(24px,3.6vw,52px);line-height:1.2;margin:0 auto;text-wrap:balance;">
        <span style="display:block;">The goal isn't to find something to change.</span><span style="display:block;color:oklch(83% 0.05 80);">It's to find what needs to align.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);padding-bottom:0;" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);padding-top:clamp(72px,12vh,130px);padding-bottom:clamp(56px,9vh,96px);">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(27px,4.6vw,66px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 clamp(32px,6vh,60px);max-width:18ch;">
        The first job isn't to make something.<br>
        <span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(38% 0.15 17);">It's to decide what is worth making.</span>
      </h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);padding-top:0;">
        <div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:oklch(30% 0.01 30);">
          <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">This is where we step back.</p>
          <p style="margin:0;">We look at the business, the offer, the positioning, the audience, the brand and the ambitions behind them.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:oklch(30% 0.01 30);">
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,24px);line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 6px;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);">Sometimes the answer is a new identity.</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,24px);line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 6px;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);">Sometimes it's a sharper offer.</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(19px,1.8vw,24px);line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 6px;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);">Sometimes the website is the problem.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">Sometimes the website is perfectly fine — and something else is getting in the way.</p>
          <p style="margin:0;">We're interested in finding that out before we start designing around an assumption.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:clamp(48px,8vh,88px);">
        <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(47% 0.17 19);margin:0 0 12px;">The outcome</p>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,44px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 20px;">A clearer direction.</p>
        <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 12px;color:oklch(30% 0.01 30);">Not a strategy document that exists mainly to prove we did strategy.</p>
        <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;color:oklch(30% 0.01 30);">A practical understanding of what needs to change, what doesn't, and what comes next.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width:min(1200px, calc(100% - 2*clamp(20px,5vw,56px)));margin:0 auto;"><div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/7;overflow:hidden;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/ap_outcome.webp" alt="Team reviewing brand direction around a table with a Spanish coastal town behind them" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 45%;"></div></div>
  </section>

  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);padding-top:clamp(72px,12vh,130px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,12vh,130px);">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(27px,4.6vw,66px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 clamp(32px,6vh,60px);max-width:16ch;">
        Once the direction is clear,<br>
        <span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(38% 0.15 17);">the work gets much easier.</span>
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 clamp(32px,5vh,48px);max-width:56ch;">This is where strategy becomes something people can actually see, use and experience.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:clamp(12px,1.5vw,20px);"><div class="wk" style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,27px);line-height:1.15;background:oklch(33% 0.065 20);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">The brand.</div><div class="wk" style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,27px);line-height:1.15;background:oklch(89% 0.006 60);color:oklch(20% 0.012 40);">The message.</div><div class="wk" style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,27px);line-height:1.15;background:oklch(33% 0.065 20);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">The website.</div><div class="wk" style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,27px);line-height:1.15;background:oklch(89% 0.006 60);color:oklch(20% 0.012 40);">The digital experience.</div><div class="wk" style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,27px);line-height:1.15;background:oklch(33% 0.065 20);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);">The marketing.</div><div class="wk" style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,27px);line-height:1.15;background:oklch(89% 0.006 60);color:oklch(20% 0.012 40);">The systems behind it.</div></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(24px,5vw,80px);align-items:end;margin-top:clamp(48px,8vh,88px);">
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;max-width:46ch;">We bring the right pieces together according to what the business actually needs — rather than trying to find a reason to use everything we can do.</p>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px);line-height:1.3;margin:0;justify-self:end;text-align:right;">Because execution without direction is just activity.<br>And activity isn't the same thing as progress.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);padding-top:clamp(72px,12vh,130px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,12vh,130px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(27px,4.6vw,66px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 clamp(32px,6vh,60px);margin-bottom:24px;max-width:14ch;">
          There is discipline<br>in knowing what <span style="font-style:italic;color:oklch(38% 0.15 17);">not</span> to change.
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;color:oklch(30% 0.01 30);">We don't believe in changing things just because we can.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 0;max-width:28ch;">We don't add strategy because a proposal is supposed to have strategy.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 6%;max-width:28ch;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);">We don't recommend a rebrand because the existing logo is a few years old.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 12%;max-width:28ch;">We don't build a new website when the real problem is the offer.</p><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,31px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 clamp(14px,2.2vh,22px) 18%;max-width:28ch;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);">And we don't believe more marketing can compensate for a business that isn't clear about what it's selling.</p></div>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px);line-height:1.3;margin:clamp(24px,4vh,40px) 0 0 24%;">That's part of our job too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="transition:opacity 0.9s ease, transform 0.9s ease;background:oklch(97% 0.012 70);" class="rv">
    <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);padding-top:clamp(72px,12vh,130px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,12vh,130px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:center;">
      <div style="position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="../uploads/ap_relationship.webp" alt="Founder working through brand materials at her desk" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 45%;filter:saturate(0.85);"></div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 6px;">You know your business.</p>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 28px;color:oklch(38% 0.07 20);">We know how to look at it from the outside.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 28px;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);font-weight:500;">That's the relationship we want.</p>
        <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 4px;color:oklch(30% 0.01 30);">Not someone waiting for instructions.</p>
        <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 28px;color:oklch(30% 0.01 30);">Not someone arriving with a predetermined solution.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">You bring the context, the experience and the ambition.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 28px;">We bring perspective, questions, strategy and the ability to turn the answer into something real.</p>
        <p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);font-size:clamp(20px,2.1vw,26px);line-height:1.25;margin:0;">The best work happens somewhere in between.</p>
